sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Python Agent
    participant C as GuidepupClient
    participant S as Node.js RPC Server
    participant B as Playwright Browser
    participant V as macOS VoiceOver
    participant W as Web Page

    A->>C: call("browser.start", { url })
    C->>S: JSON-RPC request
    S->>B: launch Chromium + open page
    B->>W: navigate to URL
    W-->>B: page load / DOM / accessibility tree
    B-->>S: page events + title + snapshot
    S-->>C: { ok: true }

    A->>C: call("voiceover.start")
    C->>S: JSON-RPC request
    S->>V: start VoiceOver capture
    V-->>S: spoken text + item state
    S-->>C: ok

    A->>C: call("voiceover.next")
    C->>S: request
    S->>V: next item / next command
    V->>W: navigate accessibility focus
    V-->>S: current spoken phrase + cursor info
    S-->>C: ok

    A->>C: call("daemonstate.snapshot")
    C->>S: request
    S-->>C: pageUrl, pageTitle, ariaSnapshot,\nvoiceOverInfo, screenshotPath, events
    C-->>A: snapshot

    A->>A: interpret snapshot + decide next action